II.. RECESS INTO CLOSED SESSION {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\i\fs24 At 4:32 PM, the City Council recessed into Closed Session.\i0\par
}


III.. RECONVENE INTO OPEN SESSION {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\fs22 At 5:55 PM, the City Council reconvened into Open Session with the exception of Councilmember Tarnay being absent.\cf1\i0\fs24\par
}


IV.. CLOSED SESSION ANNOUNCEMENT IN OPEN SESSION {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\fs22 Sitting Labor Negotiator Attorney Brown announced that the City Council went into Closed Session. In accordance to Government Code Section 54957, there was no reportable action taken.\cf1\i0\fs24\par
}


G.. ADJOURNMENT {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\fs22 At 5:55 PM, Mayor Lesser adjourned the meeting to the Adjourned Regular Meeting on Tuesday, May 12, 2026, at 6:00 PM.\cf1\i0\fs24\par
}


